== Description ==

'''Solar Battery''' is a melee weapon in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Electronics Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 4 downstream recipes at the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Sensor Spike]], [[Laser Trap]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

